{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 17:16:49.457448", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Description\\nThe network is a 4-tier data center Clos topology using EBGP. It consists of super-spine, spine, leaf routers, service hosts, DNS servers, and web servers. The DNS servers provide authoritative A records for the pod zones, and the web servers host HTTP services. External clients access these services via routed Clos fabric.\\n\\n#### Hosts and IPs\\n- **Client Host:** `client_0` (192.168.0.2)\\n- **DNS Server:** `dns_pod0` (10.0.0.2)\\n- **Web Server:** `webserver0_pod0` (10.0.1.2)\\n\\n#### Observations from Reachability Test\\nThe reachability test results indicate the following:\\n1. **Client to Web Server (`client_0` → `webserver0_pod0`):**\\n   - Status: Unknown\\n   - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or round-trip times.\\n\\n2. **Client to DNS Server (`client_0` → `dns_pod0`):**\\n   - Status: Unknown\\n   - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or round-trip times.\\n\\n3. **DNS Server to Web Server (`dns_pod0` → `webserver0_pod0`):**\\n   - Status: Unknown\\n   - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or round-trip times.\\n\\n4. **Web Server to DNS Server (`webserver0_pod0` → `dns_pod0`):**\\n   - Status: Unknown\\n   - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or round-trip times.\\n\\n#### Diagnosis\\nThe network appears to have significant issues with reachability:\\n- All tested connections between hosts (client, DNS server, and web server) are marked as \"unknown.\"\\n- There is no evidence of successful packet transmission or reception between any of the hosts.\\n- Round-trip time metrics are unavailable, suggesting potential routing, configuration, or connectivity problems.\\n\\n#### Next Steps\\nFurther investigation is required to:\\n1. Verify the network configuration of individual hosts and routers.\\n2. Check the BGP routing tables and configurations on the routers.\\n3. Inspect the DNS server and web server functionality.\\n4. Analyze the physical and logical connectivity between devices.\\n\\nThis report highlights the abnormal behavior in the network, specifically the lack of reachability between critical components., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='c4a586ac-96ac-46d5-a6a9-7dfe54e25a82'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
